{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"严格幺半范畴"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“严格幺半范畴”"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>严格幺半范畴是一种特殊的"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", 其中的结合子 (associator) 与幺子 (unitor) 是恒等自然变换.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"置换范畴","text":"置换范畴"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}